{"id":66685,"date":"2026-01-14T08:26:00","date_gmt":"2026-01-14T07:26:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66685"},"modified":"2026-09-04T00:46:25","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T23:46:25","slug":"corrida-do-carnaval-rio-tinto","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-do-carnaval-rio-tinto\/","title":{"rendered":"10\u00aa Corrida do Carnaval \u2013 Rio Tinto\/Gondomar 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">10\u00aa Corrida do Carnaval \u2013 Rio Tinto\/Gondomar 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>10\u00aa Corrida do Carnaval \u2013 Rio Tinto\/Gondomar 2027<\/strong> \u00e9 uma celebra\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica e carnavalesca de refer\u00eancia no concelho de <strong>Gondomar<\/strong>, organizada pela <strong>ProEvents<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Gondomar<\/strong>, a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Rio Tinto<\/strong> e o <strong>Sport Clube de Rio Tinto<\/strong>. Com partida e meta instaladas junto ao emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Est\u00e1dio do Sport Clube de Rio Tinto<\/strong>, o evento convida-te a festejar a Ter\u00e7a-feira de Carnaval a correr ou caminhar pelas principais art\u00e9rias da cidade, num ambiente repleto de folia, anima\u00e7\u00e3o e energia contagiante.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa desportivo integra a veloz <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong>, cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico com classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral e por escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios, bem como uma participativa <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> aberta a todas as idades e fam\u00edlias. Integrando o prestigiado circuito <strong>ProEvents Running Series 2026\/2027<\/strong>, a prova atribui abastecimento l\u00edquido no percurso (km 5) e na chegada, medalha de finalista, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os primeiros classificados absolutos masculinos e femininos, garantindo todas as condi\u00e7\u00f5es para superares a tua marca pessoal em dia de festa.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\