13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 4 de outubro de 2026:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (04\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">A partir de 5 de outubro de 2026:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Encerramento das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sem medalha:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Encerramento das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com medalha:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Encerramento das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio da 10\u00aa Corrida do Carnaval \u2013 Rio Tinto 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se na Ter\u00e7a-feira de Carnaval, 9 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida simult\u00e2nea \u00e0s 10:00 junto ao Est\u00e1dio do Sport Clube de Rio Tinto, em Gondomar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e provas dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento inclui a Corrida de 10 km cronometrada (com tempo limite de 2 horas) e a Caminhada de 5 km de cariz l\u00fadico e n\u00e3o competitivo, ideal para fam\u00edlias e caminhantes de todas as idades.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e onde me posso inscrever?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km o valor \u00e9 de 10,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 4 de outubro de 2026 e de 12,00 \u20ac a partir de 5 de outubro. Na Caminhada de 5 km o valor \u00e9 de 8,00 \u20ac (ou 10,00 \u20ac com medalha inclu\u00edda). As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas online em 10corridadocarnaval.statusmarathon.run.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando posso levantar o kit de atleta e dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do secretariado decorre no Est\u00e1dio do Sport Clube de Rio Tinto (Rua de S. Mamede) na segunda-feira, 8 de fevereiro (das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e na ter\u00e7a-feira, 9 de fevereiro de 2027 (das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:00).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova conta com abastecimentos e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. A Corrida de 10 km disp\u00f5e de abastecimento l\u00edquido aos 5 km e refor\u00e7o na meta, medalha a todos os concluintes, trof\u00e9us por escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 3 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral masculina e feminina (1\u00ba 50\u20ac, 2\u00ba 30\u20ac, 3\u00ba 20\u20ac), pontuando para o ProEvents Running Series.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"10\u00aa Corrida do Carnaval \u2013 Rio Tinto\/Gondomar 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-09\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Est\u00e1dio do Sport Clube de Rio Tinto (Rua de S. Mamede, Rio Tinto)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Gondomar\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ProEvents, em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Gondomar, Junta de Freguesia de Rio Tinto e Sport Clube de Rio Tinto\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio da 10\u00aa Corrida do Carnaval \u2013 Rio Tinto 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se na Ter\u00e7a-feira de Carnaval, 9 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida simult\u00e2nea \u00e0s 10:00 junto ao Est\u00e1dio do Sport Clube de Rio Tinto, em Gondomar.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e provas dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAns